OL,3,GNEWSAHouse martin artificial nests
OL,4,Ascheme set to expand
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp to 900 artificial nest "cups" for
OL,7,Fthreatened house martins are set to be
OL,8,Finstalled in Hampshire as part of a
OL,9,Fconservation project.
OL,11,FThe birds migrate from Africa each
OL,12,Fspring and are on the UK's Red List of
OL,13,Fendangered bird species. They are
OL,14,Fthought to have suffered from a lack of
OL,15,Fwet mud to build nests during the
OL,16,Fextreme heat in the summer.
OL,18,FFollowing a pilot project, The
OL,19,FHampshire House Martins Project is
OL,20,Foffering free cups which save the birds
OL,21,Ftime and energy compared to building
OL,22,Ftheir own mud nests.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
